[input] UI event <input>
- Receive the schedule change event from Roster Schedule through its current registration @ owner.PRoster
> route

[route] Registered handler path <process>
- Rebuild the queue and lineage rows from the current schedule @ owner.PRosterScheduleHandle
- Resolve each displayed work step from a live tab title, cached stable-stage title, saved-plan source stage, or recorded work-tab fallback @ courier.LCourierWorkTitleRead(...)
@ tabset.LTabsetTitleRead(...)
- Refresh the selected-work detail after rebuilding the queue @ owner.PRosterScheduleHandle
> output

